  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "The three bin labels stay prefix, suffix, base word in that order. Never rename, translate, or shuffle them.",
      "Every stem names one real word part inside one whole word, like un in unpack. Never split a word in a false place.",
      "A bare one-syllable base word may stand alone only in tier 1. All other stems use the part-in-word shape.",
      "Keep the filled pool mixed: about one third prefix, one third suffix, one third base word.",
      "Wrong bins are the other two labels. Never add a fourth bin or a second right bin.",
      "Use only list words plus allowed_extra_words. Kid world only: school, home, food, pets, play, family, weather.",
      "Tier 3 may use pre, dis, ful, or ness, or a two-syllable base such as happy in unhappy. Never a fake affix."
    ]
  },
  "banned_patterns": [
